    <!-- Encrypted DNS -->
    <string name="dns_title">Encrypted DNS</string>
    <string name="dns_intro">vigil answers every app\'s lookups itself and forwards them to a resolver. Encrypting that hop keeps the network (Wi-Fi operator, carrier) from reading or altering your lookups, as Android\'s Private DNS does. Blocking, alerts and the DNS log work the same.</string>
